<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1966112472"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1633940126"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="フューチャー・イヴ (feat. 初音ミク)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="sasakure.UK / 初音ミク"/><amll:meta key="album" value="初音ミク「マジカルミライ」10th Anniversary OFFICIAL ALBUM"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:37.000"><div begin="00:00.120" end="03:27.322"><p begin="00:00.120" end="00:05.236" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">サヨナラと初めましてのスキマ繋ぐ愛の、非対称<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再见与初次见面</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa yo na ra to ha ji me ma shi te no</span></p><p begin="00:05.236" end="00:08.855" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">きっとこれは、少しだけ未来の話<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这定是发生在不久将来的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to ko re ha su ko shi da ke mi ra i no ha na shi</span></p><p begin="00:21.147" end="00:23.448" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">ずっと近くで歌っている(Or)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直都在身边歌唱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to chi ka ku de u ta 't te i ru (or)</span></p><p begin="00:23.699" end="00:26.216" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">ずっと遠くの場所にいる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直都在遥远天边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to to o ku no ba sho ni i ru</span></p><p begin="00:26.216" end="00:29.466" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">「僕は、僕はどっちだっただろう」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“我对你来说究竟是哪种情形”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">『 bo ku ha bo ku ha do 'c chi da 't ta da ro u 』</span></p><p begin="00:30.534" end="00:33.752" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">数えきれない昨日(機能)を追い越して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">努力追赶</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka zo e ki re na i ki no u wo</span></p><p begin="00:33.752" end="00:36.302" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">シンク(真紅)なpopにtoy(問い)をして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">数不尽的昨天(机能)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n ku na pop ni</span></p><p begin="00:36.302" end="00:40.522" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">今日は今日はどこへ行くのだろう？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断追问</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyo u ha kyo u ha</span></p><p begin="00:41.704" end="00:43.271" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">マル、バツ、ステーション<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">圆圈 红叉 车站</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ru ba tsu su te e sho n</span></p><p begin="00:43.560" end="00:45.260" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">「まだ拗ねてるの？」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“还在闹别扭吗？”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 ma da su ne te ru no ？」</span></p><p begin="00:45.495" end="00:47.129" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">虹、宙、セピカ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彩虹 宇宙 Cepica</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni ji so ra se pi ka</span></p><p begin="00:47.412" end="00:49.041" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">溢れるハレーション<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">光彩流转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a fu re ru ha re e sho n</span></p><p begin="00:49.041" end="00:50.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">またここで謳うよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再在这里高歌吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta ko ko de u ta u yo</span></p><p begin="00:50.860" end="00:52.592" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">「ねえ、生きてるよね...!?」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“呐 你还活着吧？”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 ne e i ki te ru yo ne ？」</span></p><p begin="00:52.664" end="00:54.707" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">本当は そんなこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实 我早就</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n to u ha so n na ko to</span></p><p begin="00:54.707" end="00:58.521" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">とう(十)に知っている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">清楚这一切了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to u ni shi 't te i ru</span></p><p begin="00:58.770" end="01:02.354" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">サヨナラと初めましてのスキマ繋ぐ愛を！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再见与初次见面</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa yo na ra to ha ji me ma shi te no</span></p><p begin="01:02.354" end="01:03.883" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">未来を！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将未来！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ki ma tsu na gu a i wo mi ra i wo</span></p><p begin="01:03.883" end="01:05.686" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">シアワセもフシアワセも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将幸福与不幸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi a wa se mo fu shi a wa se mo</span></p><p begin="01:05.686" end="01:08.971" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">全部抱きしめて、アイノウ(I 脳) 相追う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全数怀揣心中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n bu da ki shi me te</span></p><p begin="01:08.971" end="01:11.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">偽物でもいいよ 雨でもいいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是伪造的也好 大雨挥洒也好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u so de mo i i yo a me de mo i i yo</span></p><p begin="01:11.400" end="01:13.935" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">夢がまだ“夢”でいられるなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果梦依旧是“梦”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me ga ma da “ yu me ” de i ra re ru na ra</span></p><p begin="01:13.935" end="01:16.971" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">シニカルもラジカルもきっときっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喜欢讽刺的人也好 激进的人也好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ni ka ru mo ra ji ka ru mo</span></p><p begin="01:16.971" end="01:19.770" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">魔法を信じていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都一定 一定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ho u wo shi n ji te i ta</span></p><p begin="01:29.628" end="01:32.179" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">ずっと変わらない世界と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不曾改变的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to ka wa ra na i se ka i to</span></p><p begin="01:32.179" end="01:34.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">変わってしまった世界と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彻底变化的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa 't te shi ma 't ta se ka i to</span></p><p begin="01:34.730" end="01:38.698" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">「僕は、僕はどっちだっただろう」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“我对你来说究竟是哪种情形”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">『 bo ku ha bo ku ha do 'c chi da 't ta da ro u 』</span></p><p begin="01:39.082" end="01:42.362" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">幾つも幾重にも日々(皹)重ねた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时间不断流转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ku tsu mo i ku e ni mo</span></p><p begin="01:42.362" end="01:44.863" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">“もっと近く”が遠かった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“再近一点”是如此遥远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">“ mo 't to chi ka ku ” ga to o ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:44.863" end="01:46.194" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">僕は僕は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是 我是</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ha bo ku ha</span></p><p begin="01:46.194" end="01:51.608" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">シンク(真紅)なpopにtoy(問い)かけるラジオ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向水槽(赤红)的流行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n ku na pop ni</span></p><p begin="01:48.902" end="01:51.603" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">夢に夢みてるシナリオ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是在梦中梦见的剧本吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me ni yu me mi te ru shi na ri o ？</span></p><p begin="01:51.826" end="01:55.394" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">サヨナラと初めましてのスキマ繋ぐ愛を！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再见与初次见面</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa yo na ra to ha ji me ma shi te no</span></p><p begin="01:55.394" end="01:56.827" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">未来を！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将未来！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ki ma tsu na gu a i wo mi ra i wo</span></p><p begin="01:56.827" end="01:58.803" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">ガラクタも枯れた惑星も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将琐碎的事情和干涸的星球</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ga ra ku ta mo ka re ta ho shi mo</span></p><p begin="01:58.803" end="02:01.936" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">全部抱きしめて、アイノウ(I 脳) 相追う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全数怀揣心中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n bu da ki shi me te</span></p><p begin="02:01.936" end="02:04.454" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">エゴでもいいよ ノイズでもいいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自私又何妨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e go de mo i i yo</span></p><p begin="02:04.454" end="02:07.006" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">君がまだ“君”をやめないなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">发出噪音又何妨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ga ma da “ ki mi ” wo ya me na i na ra</span></p><p begin="02:07.006" end="02:09.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">ロジカルもミシカルもきっときっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">遵循逻辑的人 喜欢幻想的人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ro ji ka ru mo mi shi ka ru mo</span></p><p begin="02:09.970" end="02:12.937" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">魔法を信じていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都一定 一定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ho u wo shi n ji te i ta</span></p><p begin="02:15.733" end="02:18.952" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">ヒトリボッチをこえて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不再是孤独一人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to ri bo 'c chi wo ko e te</span></p><p begin="02:18.952" end="02:22.171" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">せなかあわせのイヴ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那背靠背的夜晚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se na ka a wa se no i vu</span></p><p begin="02:22.171" end="02:25.336" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">ながれぼしサカサマのおとがする<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">流星发出了扭曲的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ga re bo shi sa ka sa ma no o to ga su ru</span></p><p begin="02:25.336" end="02:26.615" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">「行かないで...！」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“不要走”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">『 i ka na i de 』</span></p><p begin="02:26.615" end="02:27.366" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">手を伸ばす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不禁伸出双手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te wo no ba su</span></p><p begin="02:27.366" end="02:28.215" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">0を刻む<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">０点的时刻烙印心中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze ro wo ki za mu</span></p><p begin="02:28.215" end="02:34.201" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">夢から覚めた、けれど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然我已从梦中醒来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me ka ra sa me ta ke re do</span></p><p begin="02:34.637" end="02:39.735" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">君が隣にいて、隣にいない世界の続きを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但你在我身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ga to na ri ni i te</span></p><p begin="02:39.735" end="02:45.642" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">愛しさも絶望も全部抱きしめた感情を、もう一度...！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将爱 绝望 全部</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i to shi sa mo ze tsu bo u mo ze n bu</span></p><p begin="02:45.878" end="02:51.026" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">サヨナラも初めましても一緒に謳おうよ、未来を！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再见也好 初次见面也好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa yo na ra mo ha ji me ma shi te mo</span></p><p begin="02:51.026" end="02:52.994" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">トンデモ宇宙も終末も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将无垠的宇宙 结局</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to n de mo u chu u mo shu u ma tsu mo</span></p><p begin="02:52.994" end="02:56.127" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">全部抱きしめて、アイノウ(I 脳) 相追う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全数怀揣心中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n bu da ki shi me te</span></p><p begin="02:56.127" end="02:58.596" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">虚無でもいいよ 闇でもいいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">内心虚无也无妨 眼前昏暗也无妨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyo mu de mo i i yo ya mi de mo i i yo</span></p><p begin="02:58.596" end="03:01.146" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">夢が、まだ“夢”が愛せるなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若梦还能继续深爱“梦”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me ga ma da “ yu me ” ga a i se ru na ra</span></p><p begin="03:01.146" end="03:04.164" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">間近に在る、ハジマリはずっとずっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">近在身旁的开端</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma di ka ni a ru</span></p><p begin="03:04.164" end="03:07.247" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">魔法を信じていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相信着魔法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ho u wo shi n ji te i ta</span></p><p begin="03:09.198" end="03:12.316" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">魔法を信じていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相信着魔法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ho u wo shi n ji te i ta</span></p><p begin="03:14.166" end="03:17.319" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">魔法を信じていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相信着魔法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ho u wo shi n ji te i ta</span></p><p begin="03:19.251" end="03:22.386" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">魔法を信じていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相信着魔法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ho u wo shi n ji te i ta</span></p><p begin="03:24.320" end="03:27.322" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60">魔法を信じていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相信着魔法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ho u wo shi n ji te i ta</span></p></div></body></tt>